      <h2>4. Manhattan Transfer Waste Claims ($50,000 or Medical Expenses)</h2>
      <p class="lede">Communities situated near Manhattan Project uranium and thorium processing and storage facilities qualify for lump-sum compensation or reimbursement of related medical costs.</p>
      <div class="btns" style="margin-top:var(--sp2)">
        <a class="btn" href="/check/">Check Manhattan Waste Eligibility</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

